{Paragon Institute for Heroic Arts (P) is a ${Choose between a "high school" or "university"} that trains heroes. The school colors of (P) are blue and gold, the mascot is a Griffin, and students wear blue and gray uniforms. (P) shares a campus with Paragon Institute for Auxiliary Arts (PA), which trains the sidekicks and support crews who work alongside (P) graduates in the field.
(P)'s major annual events are Griffins PowerBall season, Agency Day for Career Day, the annual musical Skyward!, the Paragon Spotlight talent show, the Griffin Ball, and the Rankings Gala.
(P)'s main antagonists are a century-old villain who drains powers and youth and the ghost of a (P) freshman killed by bullies, who has risen from the dead to punish the school that buried the truth.}
